WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:30.427
Tom looked for Prince Eric at the market.

2
00:00:30.428 --> 00:00:33.579
He saw the prince near an apple cart.

3
00:00:33.579 --> 00:00:39.773
Prince Eric waved. "I found an easy job.

4
00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:47.298
Selling apples!"

5
00:00:47.299 --> 00:00:50.568
A man gave the prince a coin.

6
00:00:50.568 --> 00:00:54.391
Then the man held out his hand.

7
00:00:54.391 --> 00:00:57.924
"Huh?" the prince said.

8
00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:02.220
"The prince doesn’t know how money works," Cat said.

9
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:07.447
"Servants always buy things for him."

10
00:01:07.447 --> 00:01:10.075
Tom whispered to the prince.

11
00:01:10.076 --> 00:01:13.060
"That man needs some coins back."

12
00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:16.300
"Oh!" said the prince.

13
00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.773
He gave the man a bag of coins.

14
00:01:19.773 --> 00:01:26.859
The man laughed.

15
00:01:26.859 --> 00:01:30.181
Another man came to the apple cart.

16
00:01:30.181 --> 00:01:32.758
He held out his hand.

17
00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:39.627
Prince Eric gave him a bag of coins too.

18
00:01:39.627 --> 00:01:43.476
More people ran over.

19
00:01:43.476 --> 00:01:46.285
They pushed each other.

20
00:01:46.285 --> 00:01:49.887
They pushed the prince.

21
00:01:49.887 --> 00:01:53.354
"I must do something!" Tom cried.

22
00:01:53.355 --> 00:01:59.865
Tom waved his wand. "Apple cart, roll back!"

23
00:01:59.865 --> 00:02:02.568
But the apple cart fell over.

24
00:02:02.568 --> 00:02:05.394
Apples rolled everywhere!

25
00:02:05.394 --> 00:02:08.232
"Oops," Tom said.

26
00:02:08.232 --> 00:02:12.051
"My apples!" the apple seller cried.

27
00:02:12.051 --> 00:02:17.806
Tom and the prince hurried away.

28
00:02:17.806 --> 00:02:21.788
"Let's return to the castle," Tom said.

29
00:02:21.788 --> 00:02:24.399
The prince frowned.

30
00:02:24.399 --> 00:02:37.491
"I don't want to do my lessons."

31
00:02:37.491 --> 00:02:45.011
Then he saw some boys fishing.

32
00:02:45.011 --> 00:02:54.202
"I'll be a fisherman!"

33
00:02:54.202 --> 00:02:58.616
The prince ran onto a boat.

34
00:02:58.616 --> 00:03:11.904
Tom sighed and followed him.

35
00:03:11.904 --> 00:03:14.536
"Uh-oh," Cat whispered.

36
00:03:14.536 --> 00:03:29.036
"This boat is leaking!"
